    <description>Tutanota is the world's most secure email service, easy to use and private by design. Sign up for free encrypted email now.

With end-to-end encryption and 2FA, your emails have never been more secure. The built-in encryption guarantees that your mailbox belongs to you: Nobody can decrypt or read your data.

**Please Note**: This is an automatically updated package. If you find it is out of date by more than a day or two, please contact the maintainer(s) and let them know the package is no longer updating correctly.</description>
    <summary>Tutanota is an email client with a strong focus on security and privacy that lets you encrypt emails on all your devices.</summary>
    <releaseNotes># What's new
 - Improve progress indicator when indexing mails [#11492](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11492)
 - Download all mail details archives (one at a time) first, then download and index mails [#11417](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11417)
 - Add delay before expanding folders during drag-and-drop [#11329](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11329)

# Bugfixes
 - Logged errors retrieved as `?` when getting logs [#11582](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11582)
 - Mail Details are not being cached and are deleted after indexing [#11422](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11422)
 - Colors for labels cannot be edited [#11575](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11575)
 - Mail ReplyType updated before the reply is sent [#11545](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11545)
 - [mac]Date picker in search view is not fully visible [#11513](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11513)
 - [WebApp] Cannot enable mail indexing from SearchView in Two/One column layout [#11499](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11499)
 - External Content Blocked Banner always shown even when external content is allowed for sender [#11474](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11474)
 - Search input loses focus after edit when searching for contact [#11451](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11451)

# Milestone
https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/milestone/456?closed=1


